msgid "Ahhhh, this stupid necklace doesn't work at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Ever since I put this thing on, my luck's only gotten worse!\r\n"
"First I lost my wallet, then my tutor flat-out rejects me...\r\n"
"What else could possibly go wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that, but⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I don't care about your apologies! All I want is my money\r\n"
"back! So here, take this worthless piece of junk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I offer my deepest sympathies, young lady, but unfortunately\r\n"
"we cannot accept used goods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I can tell you where the company that makes these necklaces\r\n"
"is located. How about taking your complaint there instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Geez! I don't know how you people stay in business..."
msgstr ""

